      "writtenOn": "2025-01-31T09:14:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would cause to force the `IndexType.SYS_PROP` to be `lucene`, however, Google doesn\u0027t use Lucene and they\u0027ll have to be dependent from this test passing.\n\nWhy not doing a `TruthJunit.assume()` that `IndexType.SYS_PROP` is set to `lucene` instead? That would make the whole tests to be skipped *IF* you are not explicitly testing Lucene.\n\nLastly, as a follow-up, we should consider moving all the Lucene tests in a separate package and having a specific BUILD file for it, NOT invoked by default but only in our CI jobs.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 28,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 65
      },
